### Flash-Sale Order & Inventory API — VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8101
@customerEmail = demo@flashsale.local
@customerPassword = Demo@1234
@adminEmail = admin@flashsale.local
@adminPassword = Admin@1234
@idempotencyKey = demo-checkout-001

### 1. Health Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### 2. Customer Login (captures accessToken for requests below)
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{customerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{customerPassword}}"
}

###
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3. Browse Active Flash-Sale Products (Cache-Aside)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?activeOnly=true&page=0&size=10&sort=id,asc

### 4. List Active Flash Vouchers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/active

### 5. Atomically Claim Limited Voucher Quota
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/FLASH20/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 6. Idempotent Order Checkout (Creates order + 15-min stock hold)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "voucherCode": "FLASH20"
}

###
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Safe Network Retry Replay (Same Idempotency-Key + Identical Body -> X-Idempotency-Replayed: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "voucherCode": "FLASH20"
}

### 8. Idempotency Payload Mismatch Conflict (Same Key + Different Body -> 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "voucherCode": "FLASH20"
}

### 9. Confirm Payment on Created Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 10. Admin Login (ROLE_ADMIN)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 11. Admin Inventory Restock with Optimistic Version Check
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/1/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availableQty": 40,
  "expectedVersion": 2
}
